<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Acid Sphere</h1>
<p>The spells of the acid sphere conjure and control acid. Your ability in the 
sphere decides how well you cast them, and also how well you resist acid 
spells cast on you (see <a cmd='#'>Help Spheres</a>).
</p><p>The acid spells, all taught by the sorcerers:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>Help Acid Drop</a>       guild level 100
<a cmd='#'>Help Spray of Acid</a>   guild level 120
<a cmd='#'>Help Acid Ball</a>       guild level 145
<a cmd='#'>Help Acid Swirl</a>      guild level 180
</pre>
<p>Dragons may also breathe acid (see <a cmd='#'>Help Breath</a>). To resist acid better, 
see <a cmd='#'>Help Acid Resistance</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Spheres</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Acid Resistance</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Sorcerer Spells</a>
</pre>




</div>